WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.720
The Bible opens: in the beginning,
God created the heavens and the earth.

2
00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:09.450
Christians believe everything
that exists depends on God,

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.110
at every moment.

4
00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.720
Yet Christians also believe
that God never changes.

5
00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:19.940
If God never changes, how can God listen
to your prayers and love you back?

6
00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:24.600
In this mission, you'll see what Christians
mean when they call God all-powerful

7
00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:26.020
and unchanging.

8
00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:29.850
Then you'll compare 2 pictures of
how a world could come from God,

9
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.410
and see which one Christians choose.

10
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:37.510
Your mission: find out how Christians
hold together a God who never changes and

11
00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:38.840
a God who loves.
